%% 23 PD until 51-4-276 PD %%

Bleeding Rivers was a period of anarchy and civil war following [[sorrows-dawn|Sorrow's Dawn]]. It started when the a Cuthage Emperor abdicated in the year 23, citing a broken right to rule. The Empire fell. The Governments left behind by the Empire were able to steer the citizens on a local level, yet lacked the national influence. Starting one of many leaderless times in this period. 

Years, on the 54th of Kavi 29, later a group known as the Progress Society established the first government in a land now known as [[enkoa|Enkoa]]. Following their declaration, they faced fierce opposition from the local elite. They formed the Restoration Syndicate opposing the Progress Society and vowing for a return to the old ways of Monarchy. These two groups would clash in battle within months.

The next 100 years would see constant innovations in warfare and clashes over small villages. Hunderds and thousands of lives were lost to see the Vianis Delta be shaped in their future. Yet in all the losses and grueling these two movements were able to establish form of government, an organized military and far stretching relations with their neighbors.   

Hostilities were wavering following a century of war. A *de facto* peace had occurred, following the rule of *Uti possidetis*. The Porgress Society eventually evolved into the modern Republics of [[enkoa|Enkoa]] and [[taerian|Taerian]], while the Restoration Seyndicate became the Kingdoms of [[amdell|Amdell]] and [[yuashir|Yuashir]].

After the signing of the [[peace-of-kissos|Peace of Kissos]] on the 51st of Kuresohl 276 PD, in the former imperial capital, the nation of [[yuashir|Yuashir]] and [[enkoa|Enkoa]] have made much progress in their relationship and connection. [[enkoa|Enkoa]] and [[taerian|Taerian]] have similarly improved their connections, yet [[amdell|Amdell]] remains isolated and mercantilist. They prefer to do business with the neighbouring nations in [[the-rift|The Rift]]
